    "text": "01. Lot No. 1Name of Land: Dolewatta; Description: Open waste land;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: W. S. M. S. Fernando,No. 72, Wijaya Road, Thudella, Ja-ela; Extent: 0.0092 Hectare.",
